{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52149","headline":"四言奉陪皇太子释奠诗一首应令 五 · 许敬宗","name":"四言奉陪皇太子释奠诗一首应令 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天庭朗玉，睿掌晖珠。\n问安昏定，奉礼晨趋。\n照宣离景，几亚神抠。\n承纶太极，肄业鸿都。\n（其五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}